                <head>104. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>
                    AID Administrator David E. Bell visited Paris February 21–23, Bonn February 23–24,
                    and London, February 24–27, 1965, to discuss possible strategies for the
                    improvement of the coordination of U.S. and European worldwide economic aid
                    programs. Documentation on Bell’s trip is
                    in the Washington National Records Center, RG 286, DAC Material: FRC 70 A 5922;
                    Trip—Administrator David Bell, Paris,
                    Bonn, London, February 21–27, 1965. For Bell’s report on his trip and AID senior level discussion about it, see <ref target="#d105"
                        >Documents 105</ref> and <ref target="#d106">106</ref>.</p>
            </div>
